changes prior to Version 1.0.7.

Version 1.0.7

  ePiX now uses autoconf:

    ./configure
    make all
    make install


  The build command, which is equivalent to "make doc samples",
  accepts the following targets (among many others):

    make doc         -- manual
    make samples     -- sample document
    make contrib     -- contrib library
    make contrib-doc -- contrib manual
